    {
      "text": "<size=140%><b>Make room for a better balance</b></size>\n\n<b>01   Choose → inspect → place</b>\nUse the three treatments to explore a proposal. Inspect a site to see its exact cost and productive change. All production units are illustrative game accounting.\n\n<b>02   Explore the valley</b>\nDrag to orbit · Shift-drag to pan · Scroll or + / − to zoom\nF focuses a site · R returns to the valley\n\n<b>03   Experiment freely</b>\n1 / 2 / 3: tools · M: living margin · Tab: next site\nEnter: place · Z: undo · Escape: cancel or close\nG: field guide · ?: controls\n\nRunoff estimates are not available in this slice.",
